# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

This application was created with Vellum's `imported-app` template. The initial
design snapshot, normalized DesignIR, tokens, assets, generated UI, diagnostics,
and import receipt were materialized by `vellum create --from`.

Keep behavior in `src/` and imported output under the tool-owned paths described
by `AGENTS.md`. To update the design without overwriting behavior:

```sh
vellum reimport --source path/to/revision.pulp.zip --as main
vellum design check --as main
vellum test --scenario smoke
```

The initial smoke scenario proves that the imported scene boots and renders. Add
semantic actions only after binding them to stable imported identities.
